    "steps": [
      "Fix the two TT gear motors to the chassis and press a 65 mm wheel onto each shaft. Put the caster ball at the back.",
      "Wire the battery to VIN on the Uno and to VM on the TB6612FNG, and join the grounds.",
      "Wire the driver: PWMA to D5, AIN1 to D7, AIN2 to D8, PWMB to D6, BIN1 to D10, BIN2 to D4. Put STBY on 5 V.",
      "Press Run. The robot drives forward for 2 s, turns left about 90 degrees and stops.",
      "Change CRUISE and TURN_MS in the sketch and run again: PWM sets the speed, and the time sets the distance and the angle.",
      "Open the Robot checks and the top-down view, then enable a fault and run again."
    ],
